# Raw comparative benchmark output (machine- and load-specific; reproduce via
# `mise run python:benchmark`). The distilled, published numbers ARE committed, under
# benchmarks/published/ — see ADR 0030.
/benchmark-results

# Local PDF-rasterization output (reproduce via `mise run python:rasterize`); not published to
# the test_documents bucket by this repo, see ADR 0034 and sceptre_rs_tools/rasterize.py.
/rasterized-pages

